To get started, we can use MATLAB's econometrics toolbox to estimate a vector autoregression (VAR) model. This type of model allows us to examine the dynamic relationship between multiple time series variables, such as stock prices, GDP, and interest rates.
Here's an example of how to estimate a VAR model in MATLAB:
```matlab
% Load data
